    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">successful enrollment and
    completion of preclinical studies and clinical trials with favorable results;</span></td></tr>
